    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short and engaging visual novel immerses you in the haunted woods surrounding Mirrorstone National Park, where you\u2019re forced to face your demons \u2014 both literal and figurative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friends are trying to help you contact your twin sister on the anniversary of her death by trespassing on land  known to attract all kinds of spiritual activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2022 Seance complete with animated spirit board\u00a0<br>\u2022 Choose your path: Cozy horror\u00a0<i>or</i> emotional resonance<br>\u2022 100% Handmade Artwork\u00a0<br>\u2022 Atmospheric sound design<br>\u2022 Original soundtrack by Jeramy Parker</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short and engaging visual novel immerses you in the haunted woods surrounding Mirrorstone National Park, where you\u2019re forced to face your demons \u2014 both literal and figurative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friends are trying to help you contact your twin sister on the anniversary of her death by trespassing on land  known to attract all kinds of spiritual activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2022 Seance complete with animated spirit board\u00a0<br>\u2022 Choose your path: Cozy horror\u00a0<i>or</i> emotional resonance<br>\u2022 100% Handmade Artwork\u00a0<br>\u2022 Atmospheric sound design<br>\u2022 Original soundtrack by Jeramy Parker</p>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019re a teen trespassing on sacred private property to hold a seance for your deceased twin, but something goes terribly wrong.",
